      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The main submission or creation action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg> Create an order</button>",
